@url = http://localhost:1106/api/v2/staticdata

### list of NHL position codes
GET {{url}}/positions?sport=NHL

### list of NBA position codes
GET {{url}}/positions?sport=NBA

### list of NFL position codes
GET {{url}}/positions?sport=NFL

### list of MLB position codes
GET {{url}}/positions?sport=MLB

### list of FIF position codes
GET {{url}}/positions?sport=FIF

### list of PGA position codes
GET {{url}}/positions?sport=PGA

### list of NFL position codes (sportCode alias)
GET {{url}}/positions?sportCode=NFL

### list of FIF teams
GET {{url}}/teams?sport=FIF

### list of PGA teams
GET {{url}}/teams?sport=PGA

### list of NBA teams
GET {{url}}/teams?sport=NBA
